        "zh": "俯卧撑",
        "en": "Push-Up"
      },
      "summary": {
        "zh": "胸部推举与肘伸展配合，躯干同时保持稳定。",
        "en": "A bodyweight press combining chest work, elbow extension and trunk stability."
